    "module_designation": "Separate module (indicator)",
    "description": "Electronic indicator type X112-B presented as a separate module intended to be integrated in a non-automatic weighing instrument. Commercial versions: i20 (general use), i30 and i35 (appropriate for weighing bridges), i40 (weighing in a process) or d20 (as a repeater). The box is metallic and presented as a 'table' version, a 'cabinet back panel' version or a 'front of housing' version. Intended to be connected to a weighing channel comprising analogue or digital strain gauge load cells. Revision 2 added a version with a housing made of composite material, a version with housing integrating a junction box (i40JB), and a weight filling application (version i…EDU)."
